    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\"><strong>This clash is in Reverse mode only.</strong><br><br>PAT maps every zone before entering. It compresses the threat data to save memory &mdash; each row is stored as run-length encoded <strong>tokens</strong>: a digit for the <strong>threat</strong> value followed by a digit for the <strong>repeat count</strong>.<br><br>52 means threat category 5, repeated 2 times.<br>Threat categories render as ASCII characters:<br><br>0 &rarr; . (clear)<br>3 &rarr; + (low)<br>5 &rarr; # (medium)<br>8 &rarr; * (high)<br><br>Reconstruct and print PAT's threat map.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> An integer <var>N</var>, the number of rows.<br><strong>Next <var>N</var> rows:</strong> Space-separated tokens <var>row</var>, each a 2-character string token<br>representing a threat value and its repeat count, space separated.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong><var>N</var> rows:</strong> Each line of the threat map rendered as ASCII characters.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &le; <var>N</var> &le; 10<br>2 &le; length of <var>row</var> &le; 29<br><var>row</var> tokens use threat values in {0, 3, 5, 8}, repeat counts in 1&ndash;9 and all rows are equal length.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">5\n02 51 02\n02 51 02\n55\n02 51 02\n02 51 02</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">..#..\n..#..\n#####\n..#..\n..#..</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
